<title>UK: BS Group sells UK properties for 19 mln stg.</title>
<headline>BS Group sells UK properties for 19 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK propertry and leisure company BS Group said on Monday it was to sell properties in Bristol, western England, to investment companies associated with Ikea Ltd for 19 million stg cash.  </p>
<p>The properties comprise the freehold interests in Eastgate Retail Park and the adjoining Bristol stadium.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
